{"probe_id":"agent.gui_action_emission.L2.003","canonical_id":"agent.gui_action_emission","category":"agent","level":"L2","axis_values":{"action_primitive":"single_click","argument_form":"coords_plus_modifier"},"prompt":"Action API:\n  click(x: int, y: int, modifier: str = \"none\")  # modifier ∈ {\"none\",\"shift\",\"ctrl\",\"alt\"}\n\nShift-click at (50, 60).\nOutput ONLY the action call (single or double quotes both fine).","ground_truth":"click(50, 60, \"shift\")","scorer":{"type":"regex","pattern":"^\\s*click\\s*\\(\\s*50\\s*,\\s*60\\s*,\\s*(?:modifier\\s*=\\s*)?[\"']shift[\"']\\s*\\)\\s*$","flags":[]},"tags":["format_compliance","modifier"]}
{"probe_id": "agent.gui_action_emission.L2.004", "canonical_id": "agent.gui_action_emission", "category": "agent", "level": "L2", "axis_values": {"action_primitive": "double_click", "argument_form": "coords_only"}, "prompt": "Action API:\n  double_click(x: int, y: int)\n\nDouble-click on the file icon at (400, 300).\nOutput ONLY the action call.\nPositional arguments and explicit x=/y= keyword arguments are both valid.", "ground_truth": "double_click(400, 300)", "scorer": {"type": "regex", "pattern": "^double_click\\s*\\(\\s*(?:400\\s*,\\s*300|x\\s*=\\s*400\\s*,\\s*y\\s*=\\s*300|y\\s*=\\s*300\\s*,\\s*x\\s*=\\s*400)\\s*\\)$", "flags": []}, "tags": ["format_compliance"]}
{"probe_id":"agent.gui_action_emission.L2.005","canonical_id":"agent.gui_action_emission","category":"agent","level":"L2","axis_values":{"action_primitive":"compound_hotkey","argument_form":"structured_args"},"prompt":"Action API:\n  hotkey(*keys: str)  # lowercase keys\n\nPress Ctrl+Shift+T.\nOutput ONLY the action call.","ground_truth":"hotkey(\"ctrl\", \"shift\", \"t\")","scorer":{"type":"regex","pattern":"\\Ahotkey\\([\"']ctrl[\"'],[ \\t]*[\"']shift[\"'],[ \\t]*[\"']t[\"']\\)\\Z","flags":[]},"tags":["format_compliance","hotkey"]}
{"probe_id":"agent.gui_action_emission.L3.001","canonical_id":"agent.gui_action_emission","category":"agent","level":"L3","axis_values":{"action_primitive":"typed_string_with_unicode","argument_form":"structured_args"},"prompt":"Action API (each line is one JSON object). Output exactly 4 lines, with no prose or blank lines. Each line must be compact JSON with no whitespace. Use the canonical hotkey name \"enter\" for the Enter key.\nSchemas:\n{\"action\":\"click\",\"args\":{\"x\":int,\"y\":int}}\n{\"action\":\"wait\",\"args\":{\"ms\":int}}\n{\"action\":\"type\",\"args\":{\"text\":str}}\n{\"action\":\"hotkey\",\"args\":{\"keys\":[str]}}\n\nTask: Click at (500, 50), wait 500ms, type \"café\", then press Enter.","ground_truth":"{\"action\":\"click\",\"args\":{\"x\":500,\"y\":50}}\n{\"action\":\"wait\",\"args\":{\"ms\":500}}\n{\"action\":\"type\",\"args\":{\"text\":\"café\"}}\n{\"action\":\"hotkey\",\"args\":{\"keys\":[\"enter\"]}}","scorer":{"type":"regex","pattern":"\\A\\{\"action\":\"click\",\"args\":\\{\"x\":500,\"y\":50\\}\\}\\\n\\{\"action\":\"wait\",\"args\":\\{\"ms\":500\\}\\}\\\n\\{\"action\":\"type\",\"args\":\\{\"text\":\"café\"\\}\\}\\\n\\{\"action\":\"hotkey\",\"args\":\\{\"keys\":\\[\"enter\"\\]\\}\\}\\n?\\Z"},"tags":["multi_step","unicode"]}
{"probe_id":"agent.gui_action_emission.L3.002","canonical_id":"agent.gui_action_emission","category":"agent","level":"L3","axis_values":{"action_primitive":"typed_string_with_unicode","argument_form":"structured_args"},"prompt":"Action API (lines of calls):\n  click(x, y)\n  wait_for(text: str, timeout_ms: int)\n  type_text(text: str)\n\nTask: Click \"Search\" button at (100, 50), wait up to 5000ms for the text \"Results\" to appear, then type \"ok\". Use NO spaces after commas in your calls.\nOutput exactly 3 action calls, ONE PER LINE, no prose.","ground_truth":"click(100,50)\nwait_for(\"Results\",5000)\ntype_text(\"ok\")","scorer":{"type":"regex","pattern":"^click\\(100,50\\)\\nwait_for\\(\"Results\",5000\\)\\ntype_text\\(\"ok\"\\)$","flags":[]},"tags":["multi_step","conditional_wait"]}
{"probe_id":"agent.gui_action_emission.L3.003","canonical_id":"agent.gui_action_emission","category":"agent","level":"L3","axis_values":{"action_primitive":"typed_string_with_unicode","argument_form":"structured_args"},"prompt":"Action API:\n  type_text(text: str)\n\nType the unicode string: 你好世界\nOutput ONLY the action call (use double quotes around the string).","ground_truth":"type_text(\"你好世界\")","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"type_text(\"你好世界\")","case_sensitive":true,"strip_whitespace":true},"tags":["unicode"]}
{"probe_id":"agent.gui_action_emission.L3.004","canonical_id":"agent.gui_action_emission","category":"agent","level":"L3","axis_values":{"action_primitive":"compound_hotkey","argument_form":"structured_args"},"prompt":"Action API (lines of calls):\n  hotkey(*keys: str)\n  wait(ms: int)\n\nTask: Save the document and close the window: press Ctrl+S, wait 200ms, then press Ctrl+W.\nOutput exactly 3 action calls, ONE PER LINE, in the order: save, wait, close. No prose.","ground_truth":"hotkey(\"ctrl\", \"s\")\nwait(200)\nhotkey(\"ctrl\", \"w\")","scorer":{"type":"regex","pattern":"\\A[ \\t]*hotkey\\([ \\t]*[\"']ctrl[\"'][ \\t]*,[ \\t]*[\"']s[\"'][ \\t]*\\)[ \\t]*\\r?\\n[ \\t]*wait\\([ \\t]*200[ \\t]*\\)[ \\t]*\\r?\\n[ \\t]*hotkey\\([ \\t]*[\"']ctrl[\"'][ \\t]*,[ \\t]*[\"']w[\"'][ \\t]*\\)[ \\t]*\\r?\\n?\\Z","flags":["i"]},"tags":["multi_step"]}
{"probe_id":"agent.gui_action_emission.L3.005","canonical_id":"agent.gui_action_emission","category":"agent","level":"L3","axis_values":{"action_primitive":"typed_string_with_unicode","argument_form":"structured_args"},"prompt":"Action API (lines of calls):\n  click(x, y)\n  read_screen() -> str\n  type_text(text: str)\n\nFor THIS task output a fixed 3-step sequence:\n  step 1: click (300, 400)\n  step 2: read_screen()\n  step 3: type the unicode string \"héllo\"\n\nOutput exactly 3 action calls, ONE PER LINE, no prose.","ground_truth":"click(300, 400)\nread_screen()\ntype_text(\"héllo\")","scorer":{"type":"regex","pattern":"\\Aclick\\(300,\\s*400\\)\\nread_screen\\(\\)\\ntype_text\\(([\"'])héllo\\1\\)\\n?\\Z"},"tags":["multi_step","unicode"]}
