{"probe_id":"agent.shared_state_coordination.L2.004","canonical_id":"agent.shared_state_coordination","category":"agent","level":"L2","axis_values":{"actors":"both","ordering_constraint":"fixed_display_order"},"prompt":"Tool catalogue:\n  ASSISTANT tools: enable_roaming\n  USER tools: grant_app_permission, toggle_data, reseat_sim_card\n\nAll four actions are required. Their execution order may be arbitrary, but list their assigned actors in EXACTLY four lines and in this display order:\n1) enable_roaming\n2) grant_app_permission\n3) toggle_data\n4) reseat_sim_card\n\nUse the format `<action> -> <actor>`, where `<actor>` must be the exact lowercase token `assistant` or `user`.","ground_truth":"enable_roaming -> assistant\ngrant_app_permission -> user\ntoggle_data -> user\nreseat_sim_card -> user","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_string","expected":"enable_roaming -> assistant\ngrant_app_permission -> user\ntoggle_data -> user\nreseat_sim_card -> user","case_sensitive":true,"strip_whitespace":true,"allow_substring":false},"tags":["actor_routing","both_sides"],"notes":"Scoring note: publishes the lowercase actor-token contract used by the scorer."}
